--- !u!114 &3625369261183925523
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 3616690468786810027}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 993d8d8b34a954049b05eb7b4bbba012, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Game::Npc
  npcName: Amethyra
  portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 7f267f10f48ab4afe93f0f8e408f159c, type: 3}
  voice: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b5dfac46aeba941cbb72c5f3bea2d323, type: 3}
  giftSound: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a142d3c7adcfa46989d2fae3161d654d, type: 3}
  conversations:
  - requires: 
    notIf: met:Amethyra
    sets: met:Amethyra
    giveGold: 0
    giveItem: 
    smallTalk: 0
    lines:
    - heroSpeaks: 0
      text: Well now, a visitor! You found my cave! Don't be frightened, {hero}. I don't bite... often.
    - heroSpeaks: 1
      text: A dragon?! Hiding up here, by the castle?
    - heroSpeaks: 0
      text: I am Amethyra, last of the amethyst dragons. I've watched over this castle for three hundred years.
    - heroSpeaks: 0
      text: Those rattling skeletons crawled up from the dungeon below. Clear them away, and the way down will open.
    - heroSpeaks: 1
      text: Won't you come and help?
    - heroSpeaks: 0
      text: My fighting days are long behind me, little one. But I'll be right here in my cave, cheering you on. Go on, {hero}!
  - requires: cleared:Level0
    notIf: told:amethyst
    sets: told:amethyst
    giveGold: 0
    giveItem: 
    smallTalk: 0
    lines:
    - heroSpeaks: 0
      text: The grounds are clear! Well done, {hero}. Now sit a moment, because I owe you the truth.
    - heroSpeaks: 0
      text: The Grey Gloom took the colour from this island when he stole the Amethyst, the heart of my crown. That's why everything is so grey. It's why I can't fly.
    - heroSpeaks: 1
      text: Who has it?
    - heroSpeaks: 0
      text: The Slime King, in the dungeon below. He's been sitting on it like a hen on an egg. Beat him, bring it back to me, and the colour will come home.
    - heroSpeaks: 0
      text: And {hero}... the Gloom took my five dragon eggs as well. One for each island. Keep your eyes open for them.
  - requires: has:amethyst
    notIf: thanked:amethyst
    sets: thanked:amethyst
    giveGold: 50
    giveItem: 
    smallTalk: 0
    lines:
    - heroSpeaks: 0
      text: My Amethyst! Oh, {hero}, you brought it home! Hold it up. See how it glows?
    - heroSpeaks: 1
      text: Everything is turning colourful!
    - heroSpeaks: 0
      text: 'Yes! The colour is coming back to the castle grounds. And look at those boots you''re wearing: made from the Slime King''s jelly. Bouncy Boots!'
    - heroSpeaks: 0
      text: With them you can hop over gaps. There were places in the grounds and in the dungeon you couldn't cross. Do you remember them? Now you can!
    - heroSpeaks: 0
      text: Go on, have a look around. I have a feeling there are treasures waiting, and maybe even one of my eggs.
  - requires: has:dragon_egg_castle
    notIf: thanked:egg_castle
    sets: thanked:egg_castle
    giveGold: 30
    giveItem: 
    smallTalk: 0
    lines:
    - heroSpeaks: 0
      text: Is that... it IS! My egg! Oh, it's warm. It's wiggling!
    - heroSpeaks: 1
      text: It was behind a gap in the dungeon.
    - heroSpeaks: 0
      text: Clever {hero}! Keep it safe with you for now. When we've found all five, we'll hatch them together. Four more to go, in the other islands.
  - requires: talks:Amethyra>=24
    notIf: snored
    sets: snored
    giveGold: 0
    giveItem: 
    smallTalk: 0
    lines:
    - heroSpeaks: 0
      text: Oh, {hero}, you again! You do like chatting. I was just... just... *yawn*...
    - heroSpeaks: 0
      text: Zzzzz... snrrrk... mmm, pancakes... snrrrk... Zzzzz...
    - heroSpeaks: 1
      text: (She's fast asleep. Her snoring rumbles like a little thunderstorm.)
    - heroSpeaks: 0
      text: Zzzz... don't wake the dragon... Zzzz... Hoo... zzzz...
  - requires: unwashed
    notIf: 
    sets: 
    giveGold: 0
    giveItem: 
    smallTalk: 0
    lines:
    - heroSpeaks: 0
      text: ...{hero}. Did you wash your hands?
    - heroSpeaks: 1
      text: Um... maybe?
    - heroSpeaks: 0
      text: A dragon knows these things. Hands wash at the sink at home, dear. Soap first, then rinse. Off you go!
  - requires: talks:Amethyra>=9
    notIf: joked:ten
    sets: joked:ten
    giveGold: 10
    giveItem: 
    smallTalk: 0
    lines:
    - heroSpeaks: 0
      text: Ten chats! That deserves my VERY best joke. What do you call a dragon who never wakes up?
    - heroSpeaks: 1
      text: What?
    - heroSpeaks: 0
      text: A SNORE-asaurus! ...No wait, I'm a dragon, not a dinosaur. A snore-a-DRAGON! Hoo hoo hoo!
    - heroSpeaks: 0
      text: Here, a tip for listening. Dragons always pay for a good audience.
  - requires: hands_washed>=5
    notIf: praised:hands
    sets: praised:hands
    giveGold: 0
    giveItem: 
    smallTalk: 0
    lines:
    - heroSpeaks: 0
      text: Is that lavender I smell? {hero}, your hands are squeaky clean!
    - heroSpeaks: 1
      text: I washed them five times!
    - heroSpeaks: 0
      text: Splendid. Cleanest hero in all of Gemhold. I'm so proud I could breathe sparkles.
  - requires: 
    notIf: 
    sets: 
    giveGold: 0
    giveItem: 
    smallTalk: 1
    lines:
    - heroSpeaks: 0
      text: 'Back again, {hero}? The way down lies east of the fountain. Mind those skeletons: all bones and bad manners.'
  - requires: 
    notIf: 
    sets: 
    giveGold: 0
    giveItem: 
    smallTalk: 1
    lines:
    - heroSpeaks: 0
      text: Knock knock.
    - heroSpeaks: 1
      text: Who's there?
    - heroSpeaks: 0
      text: Dragon.
    - heroSpeaks: 1
      text: Dragon who?
    - heroSpeaks: 0
      text: Dragon your feet won't open those stairs! Off you go! Ha!
  - requires: 
    notIf: 
    sets: 
    giveGold: 0
    giveItem: 
    smallTalk: 1
    lines:
    - heroSpeaks: 0
      text: Why didn't the skeleton go to the castle ball?
    - heroSpeaks: 1
      text: Why?
    - heroSpeaks: 0
      text: Because he had no BODY to go with! Hoo hoo hoo!
  - requires: wish:granted
    notIf: 
    sets: 
    giveGold: 0
    giveItem: 
    smallTalk: 1
    lines:
    - heroSpeaks: 0
      text: I saw the fountain sparkle! Someone's wish came true. Was it yours, {hero}?
  talkOffset: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0}
  flipbook: {fileID: 3465369928831926180}
  idleFrames:
  - {fileID: 1013168404, guid: b12f0622f36ab4fe584084408505c263, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 823873838, guid: b12f0622f36ab4fe584084408505c263, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 651522108, guid: b12f0622f36ab4fe584084408505c263, type: 3}
  - {fileID: -563746553, guid: b12f0622f36ab4fe584084408505c263, type: 3}
  talkFrames:
  - {fileID: 1365114237, guid: b12f0622f36ab4fe584084408505c263, type: 3}
  - {fileID: -1264841042, guid: b12f0622f36ab4fe584084408505c263, type: 3}
  idleFps: 3
  talkFps: 8
